Package: usbshield-agent
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: USBShield Engineering Team
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless, usbguard
Description: USBShield Client Protection Agent for Ubuntu
 USBShield Agent runs as a persistent system service to enforce per-endpoint
 USB whitelist policies, capture active user attribution, and forward events to
 the central USBShield Admin Server.
